```New LaunchAgent on Mac | MITRE T1543.001 | every 15 min, last 7 days```
index=macos sourcetype=macos:launchitems
| rex max_match=0 "launch_item=\"(?<item>[^\"]+)\""
| mvexpand item
| stats min(_time) as first_seen by item
| where first_seen >= relative_time(now(), "-15m")
| convert ctime(first_seen)
